msgctxt "ActionTransient:3543:0:0"
msgid "Delivers an attack to target and all enemies nearby it with a potency of 1,200 for the first enemy, and 35% less for all remaining enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Formless Fist</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, allowing the execution of a weaponskill that requires a certain form, without being in that form<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br>Any additional effects associated with the executed action will also be applied.<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Lunar Nadi</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Solar Nadi</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, as well as three <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Beast Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Masterful Blitz</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Tornado Kick</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 自身のＴＰを300回復する。<br>実行時に<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「闘気」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>の効果が切れる。<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>追加効果：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>自身に対する全ての敵視を半減させる<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>発動条件：</ui-edge-color></ui-color><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>「闘気V」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>効果中
#. de: Du regenerierst 300 TP und Schatten-Chakra wird beendet.<br>Zusatzeffekt: Halbiert Feindseligkeit.<br>Bedingung: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Fünftes Schatten-Chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Restaure 300 de vos PT.<br>Met fin à l'effet <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Cinquième chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Effet additionnel<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> réduit de moitié l'inimitié des ennemis envers vous.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Condition<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Cinquième chakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
