msgid "Restores own HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1,200<if ($gn68 == 21)><if ($gn72 >= 84)><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Gradually restores HP<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>200<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>15s</if></if>"
