msgctxt "ActionTransient:3561:0:0"
msgid "Removes one select detrimental effect from self or target party member. If the target is not enfeebled, a barrier is created nullifying the target's next detrimental effect suffered.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s"
