msgid "Grants target party member the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Silhouette</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, diverting to target 80% of all enmity generated by caster. No effect when target is under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Shadewalker</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 15s"
