msgid "Restores own HP and the HP of all nearby party members.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 400<br><if ($gn72 >= 70)><if ($gn68 == 28)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Faerie Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 10<br></if></if><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Aetherflow Gauge Cost:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1"
