msgid "Reduces enmity generation.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Refresh<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Refresh Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <if ($gn72 >= 48)><if ($gn68 == 33)>{80}<else>{60}</if><else>{60}</if><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 24s"
