msgid "Restores target's HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <if ($gn68 == 33)><if ($gn72 >= 85)>{800}<else>{700}</if><else>{700}</if>"
