msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 100.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Stun</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 5s (PvP 3s)<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30% chance that next parry will reset the recast timer"
